 "note": "L7 LAST STAND AND THE VERY LAST STAND. Two rings: the outer ring is both pockets (A's H, A1, A2 on the left, B's BH, B1, B2 on the right - 6 platforms, each pocket two triangles of short decks); the inner ring is the row I1 - I2 - I3 in the centre (I2 a T2), which never falls. Last Stand inward only (outer ring, then the inner ring stays); every single drop of the outer ring keeps the rest connected. Names: H, A1, A2, I1, I2, I3, B1, B2, BH.",
